  ("In practice, when an error occurs the Hugs system also produces a message" 0.1924 0.8116 0.7843 0.7960 0.7960 0.0117 0.0074 0.2281 0.0168)
  ("that provides some information about the likely cause, but these messages are" 0.1924 0.8117 0.8004 0.8121 0.8121 0.0117 0.0055 0.2833 0.0336)
